Výrazy
******

.[perex]
Sekce `expressions` rozhoduje o operátorech a výrazech: přísné porovnání `===`, `!=` místo `<>`, `&&` místo `and`, Yoda podmínky, závorky tam, kde se priorita operátorů snadno splete, a ternární operátory, které jdou napsat kratším `??`, `?:`, nebo vůbec ne.

Většina rozhodnutí sekce zkracuje zápis a význam nemění. Výjimkou je `comparison: strict`: z `==` udělá `===`, a kód, který na volném porovnání stál, se tím změní, takže oprava je riziková (risky fix). S [typy z PHPStanu |/types] ji DressCode udělá sám tam, kde porovnává hodnoty, u kterých volné i přísné porovnání dá totéž; jinde čeká na váš souhlas v klíči [`fixRisky` |/configuration#risky-fixes].

```neon
expressions:
	comparison: strict
	wordLogicalOperators: forbidden
	notEquals: '!='
	assignmentRepeatingTarget: forbidden
	ternaryTestingNull: forbidden
	ternaryReturningItsCondition: forbidden
	ternaryOfTrueAndFalse: forbidden
	doubleNegation: forbidden
```

```php .[before]
if ($status == 'paid' and $total <> 0) {  // The `==` comparison must be written `===`. // The `and` operator must be written `&&`. // The `<>` operator must be written `!=`. // The `!=` comparison must be written `!==`.
	$count = $count + 1;  // The assignment must be written `+=` instead of repeating its target.
	$name = isset($input) ? $input : 'anonymous';  // The ternary testing for null must be written with `??`.
	$title = $this->title ? $this->title : $default;  // The ternary repeating its condition must be written `?:`.
	$valid = $total > 0 ? true : false;  // Useless ternary operator, because the condition itself is the result.
	$flag = !!$value;  // The double negation `!!` must be written as a `(bool)` cast.
}
```

```php .[after]
if ($status === 'paid' && $total !== 0) {
	$count += 1;
	$name = $input ?? 'anonymous';
	$title = $this->title ?: $default;
	$valid = $total > 0;
	$flag = (bool) $value;
}
```

Na `<>` se tu sahá dvakrát: `notEquals` z něj udělá `!=` a `comparison` pak `!==`.


expressions.getClassCalls
=========================

The name of the current class, of the one the method runs through and of the parent obtained by `get_class()`, `get_called_class()`, `get_parent_class()` and `__CLASS__`, which are `self::class`, `static::class` and `parent::class`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.ModernClassNameReference` .[decision-facts]


expressions.getClassOnObjects
=============================

The class of an object obtained by `get_class($object)`, which is `$object::class`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.ModernClassNameReference` .[decision-facts]


expressions.parenthesesAfterConstruct
=====================================

`return ($x);` is `return $x;`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `forbidden` · pokrývá `include`, `no_unneeded_control_parentheses`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.ControlStructures.LanguageConstructWithParentheses`, `Squiz.Strings.EchoedStrings` .[decision-facts]


expressions.assignmentRepeatingTarget
=====================================

`$a = $a + $b` is `$a += $b`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `assign_null_coalescing_to_coalesce_equal`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.ControlStructures.RequireNullCoalesceEqualOperator`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Operators.RequireCombinedAssignmentOperator` .[decision-facts]


expressions.explicitPrecedence
==============================

An operand where logical or bitwise operators are easy to misread is parenthesized.

- `required`: always there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `required`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `Generic.CodeAnalysis.RequireExplicitBooleanOperatorPrecedence` .[decision-facts]


expressions.incrementByAssignment
=================================

`$i += 1` is `$i++`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `forbidden` · pokrývá `standardize_increment` .[decision-facts]


expressions.doubleNegation
==========================

`!!$a` is `(bool) $a`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `forbidden` · pokrývá `no_short_bool_cast` .[decision-facts]


expressions.notEquals
=====================

The operator of inequality.

- `exclamation` nebo '!=': `!=`, never `<>`
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `exclamation`, symfony `exclamation` · pokrývá `standardize_not_equals` .[decision-facts]


expressions.ternaryTestingNull
==============================

`isset($a) ? $a : $b`, `$a !== null ? $a : $b` are `$a ?? $b`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `ternary_to_null_coalescing`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.ControlStructures.RequireNullCoalesceOperator` .[decision-facts]


expressions.ternaryReturningItsCondition
========================================

`$a ? $a : $b` is `$a ?: $b`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `ternary_to_elvis_operator`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.ControlStructures.RequireShortTernaryOperator` .[decision-facts]

Zkrácení mění počet vyhodnocení podmínky a to nemusí být neškodné: `array_shift($queue) ? array_shift($queue) : null` odebere z fronty dva prvky, kdežto zkrácená podoba jen jeden. Zkracují se proto jen výrazy, jejichž opakované čtení nemá vedlejší účinek: proměnné, prvky polí, vlastnosti, konstanty a skalární hodnoty. Právě tady je vidět, co dává strom: PHP CS Fixer označuje svůj protějšek `ternary_to_elvis_operator` za rizikový, protože nad polem tokenů nerozezná volání od proměnné; tady to rozhodne strom.

```neon
expressions:
	ternaryReturningItsCondition: forbidden
```

```php .[before]
$name = $input ? $input : 'anonymous';  // The ternary repeating its condition must be written `?:`.
$size = $options['size'] ? $options['size'] : 10;  // The ternary repeating its condition must be written `?:`.
$next = array_shift($queue) ? array_shift($queue) : null;
```

```php .[after]
$name = $input ?: 'anonymous';
$size = $options['size'] ?: 10;
$next = array_shift($queue) ? array_shift($queue) : null;
```


expressions.comparison
======================

A comparison of equality.

- `strict`: `===` and `!==`, never `==` and `!=`
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `strict`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `strict_comparison` .[decision-facts]


expressions.wordLogicalOperators
================================

`and`, `or` bind weaker than `=` and are written `&&`, `||`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `Squiz.Operators.ValidLogicalOperators` .[decision-facts]


expressions.ternaryOfTrueAndFalse
=================================

`$a > 1 ? true : false` is the condition itself, where it is a boolean.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `SlevomatCodingStandard.ControlStructures.UselessTernaryOperator` .[decision-facts]


expressions.yoda
================

Which side of a comparison holds the constant, a comparison of two variables or calls staying as it is.

- `forbidden`: the variable on the left and the constant on the right, `$a === 1`
- `required`: the constant on the left, `1 === $a`, so that an accidental assignment does not compile
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `SlevomatCodingStandard.ControlStructures.DisallowYodaComparison` .[decision-facts]


expressions.backticks
=====================

`shell_exec()` instead.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `forbidden` · pokrývá `backtick_to_shell_exec` .[decision-facts]


expressions.separateIssets
==========================

`isset($a) && isset($b)` is `isset($a, $b)`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `combine_consecutive_issets` .[decision-facts]


expressions.consecutiveUnsets
=============================

`unset($a); unset($b);` is `unset($a, $b);`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `combine_consecutive_unsets` .[decision-facts]
